---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="We've Moved | Matlack Electric"
  description="Matlack Electric is a premier residential electrical contractor built for renovations — partnering with homeowners, designers, and contractors on wiring, smart home, and energy systems."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>We've Moved!</h1>
      <p>
        Hi, it's Ethan! I've relocated to Chattanooga, Tennessee to be closer to
        family and have ended my business operations in PA as of early 2026. As
        of mid 2026, Matlack Electric is now open for business in TN, and I look
        forward to what lies ahead!
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>To My PA Clients</h2>
      <p>
        Thank you for your continued support over the years. It's been a
        pleasure working with you and helping bring your projects to life. I
        wish you all the best and hope that you find a reliable electrical
        contractor for your future projects- I'm happy to provide
        recommendations. If you have any questions or need assistance with your
        electrical needs, please don't hesitate to contact me - I still have the
        same phone number and email.
      </p>
      <p>
        Regarding warranty coverage, don't worry, I will not be abandoning my PA
        clients. I will continue to support you as best I can from TN. If that
        means traveling to PA for a service call, I will do my best to
        accommodate that. I will also be available for remote support and
        guidance as needed.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>To Those in Chattanooga</h2>
      <p>
        My name is Ethan Matlack, I'm a Master Electrician, and I'm excited to
        serve the Chattanooga area. I bring with me years of experience in
        residential electrical work, specializing in remodels and custom
        lighting/ controls solutions. I look forward to collaborating with
        homeowners, designers, and general contractors to deliver high-quality
        electrical solutions for your projects.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
